    "innovation": "This paper presents a global simulation of soil dust aerosols during the Last Glacial Maximum, providing quantitative estimates of both their direct radiative forcing and their indirect forcing through interactions with cloud ice crystals, suggesting dust contributed to the period's cold climate.",
